# Editor cruft
# Generated mirror/bootstrap/build scratch artifacts
# git and let build/build-npu-ssdt.sh regenerate npu-acpi-override.cpio.
# Gitignored asset blobs (supplied at build time from cixmini-gen-assets
# Large NOE graphs: the nomic-embed-text-v1.5 .cix is ~500MB, past GitLab's
# Large rebuildable build artifacts (do NOT commit - regenerated by build scripts)
# Mesa 26.1.3 GPU compute stack (built from source on a Sky1 build host; staged at build time)
# MNEMOS offline container image — build-time OCI archive (~260MB, staged via
# `ncz install mnemos`.
# NFS/build-host like base.squashfs). Bundled into the ISO for offline
# NOTE the trailing /* -- git cannot re-include a file inside an EXCLUDED
# NPU py3.11 uv venv toolchain: relocatable CPython 3.11 (python-build-
# of this table was an unexplained binary blob nobody could rebuild.
# on the publishing host, or from a release artifact in CI)
