# Build mirrors rotated aside by make when stale (Makefile mv desktop-mirror ->
# desktop-mirror.stale-<ts>, kernel-debs -> kernel-debs.stale-<ts>, kept for inspection).
# These are build outputs; without this rule lint-platform LINT-COVER rejects the
# rotated tree and the image target fails on a clean stage0/1/2 run.
build/*.stale-*

